<section class="drops-page">
  <header class="drops-page-head"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / RELEASE INDEX</span><h1>THE<br>DROPS.</h1><p>Each release gets a number. 001 is open. 002 and 003 stay hidden until it's time.</p></header>
  <div class="drops-page-grid">
    <a class="drop-release revealed" href="{{ routes.search_url }}?view=t-shirts"><span>DROP</span><strong>001</strong><div><h2>T-SHIRTS</h2><p>REVEALED / COMING SOON</p><em>ENTER DROP 001 →</em></div></a>
    <div class="drop-release locked"><span>DROP / LOCKED</span><strong>002</strong><div><h2>UNREVEALED</h2><p>DETAILS WITHHELD</p><em>NOT YET.</em></div></div>
    <div class="drop-release locked"><span>DROP / LOCKED</span><strong>003</strong><div><h2>UNREVEALED</h2><p>DETAILS WITHHELD</p><em>STAY CLOSE.</em></div></div>
  </div>
  <section class="drop-archive">
    <div class="drop-archive-head"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / PERMANENT RECORD</span><h2>THE ARCHIVE.</h2><p>Every END CULTURE release gets a number. Once a drop is released, it stays here as part of the record.</p></div>
    <div class="drop-archive-list">
      <a href="{{ routes.search_url }}?view=t-shirts"><span>001</span><strong>T-SHIRTS</strong><small>2026 / CURRENT DROP</small><em>VIEW 001 →</em></a>
      <div class="archive-locked"><span>002</span><strong>LOCKED</strong><small>UNRELEASED</small><em>—</em></div>
      <div class="archive-locked"><span>003</span><strong>LOCKED</strong><small>UNRELEASED</small><em>—</em></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="drops-signup"><span class="micro">DON'T MISS THE NEXT REVEAL</span><h2>KNOW<br>BEFORE<br>EVERYONE.</h2>{% form 'customer' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter,drops-interest"><div class="interest-row"><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="YOUR EMAIL" required><button type="submit">JOIN THE LIST →</button></div>{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="interest-success">YOU'RE ON THE LIST.</p>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}{% endform %}</div>
</section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Drops","settings":[]}{% endschema %}